# Canonical hashes for the shared font corpus.
#
# core keeps its own copy of these faces because it is PUBLIC and must
# build standalone — it cannot depend on this private repo. That
# duplication drifted once already: NotoSansArabic-VF.ttf existed only
# in core for a day. core commits this same list and verifies its copies
# against it (scripts/check-font-hashes.sh), so divergence fails loudly
# instead of silently substituting a font at render time.
#
# Regenerate: python3 harness/gen-font-hashes.py

